  "sections": [
    {
      "id": "amir-and-metallize",
      "title": {
        "en": "Amir and Metallize"
      },
      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1017_uni2",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              }
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Amir's mechanic is her Metallize\nMetallize is gained from Hovering Metal and Metal Extraction\nMetallize can be consumed by Amir's skills to boost them\nMetallize can also be consumed by gaining shield from a card\nWhen Metallize is Activated Amir shoots an attack and also gains some shield"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "The ratio of Metallize creation and usage should try to be perfect\nNarja at max can consume 12 Metallize a turn\nNarja consuming 8 is less damage, but also less Metallize required\n12 Metallize = 2 Hovering + Extraction + E6 = 12 x 4 hits (3 Hurricane) 48\n8 Metallize = 1 Hovering + Extraction + E6 = 8 x 5 hits (4 Hurricane ) 40"
          }
        }
      ]
    },
