      "blocks": [
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Iron Wall: 1 CounterAttack each turn\nSadism: AOE Vuln and technically 0 AP if it cost reduces the right card\nEnergy Barrier: 1 Time AP and Perma CounterAttack"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1017_srt3",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              },
              "rating": "4/5"
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1017_uni4",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              },
              "rating": "2/5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Basic Shield: Activates Metallize and also refunds you, really not bad\nIron Skin: Take no damage for one turn, not really anything that requires this effect, it exhausts itself\nBelligerence: Potential draw 2 for 0 AP, its ok"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Hover 1: More\nHover 2: Counter Attack\nHover 3: Celestial\nHover 4: Exhaust\nHover 5: Upgrade"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1017_uni2",
              "note": {
                "en": "Epiphany I"
              },
              "rating": "1/5"
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1017_uni2",
              "note": {
                "en": "Epiphany II"
              },
              "rating": "3/5"
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1017_uni2",
              "note": {
                "en": "Epiphany I"
              },
              "rating": "5/5"
            },
            {
              "cardId": "c_1017_uni2",
              "note": {
                "en": "Epiphany II"
              },
              "rating": "5/5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Extract 1: Multiplicative to shield, but only 2 metallization meh\nExtract 2: 3 metallization, 3 resolve its ok\nExtract 3: 4 Metallization but conditional\nExtract 4: Celestial, but not really worth since its just 2 metalization and 3 resolve\nExtract 5: Metallization damage, the best here"
          }
        },
        {
          "type": "card-list",
          "items": [
            {
              "cardId": "c_1017_uni1",
              "note": {
                "en": ""
              },
              "rating": "4/5"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "type": "prose",
          "body": {
            "en": "Pierce 1: 3 Hits and 2 Vuln, very nice\nPierce 2: Just big damage hit, abuses Vuln\nPierce 3: 1 Vuln but gives you Metalizationm which should be unnesicary\nPierce 4: 2 Cost bad\nPierce 5: Weaken useless, besides for Bone Cutter"
          }
        },
